applies to all new subscribers. For existing subscribers, this change won’t impact your current setups. You can continue using your SAP BTP destination as before without any disruption.  See Manage Destinations.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: Deprecated\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-06-07\nValid as Of: 2024-06-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2799 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Handle Special Characters When Working with Actions\nDescription: We have added a new Handle Special Characters feature. When set to 'Yes', this feature changes single quotes to double quotes in the selected URI field. This guarantees seamless processing in OData services and APIs.  See   .\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: New\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-06-07\nValid as Of: 2024-06-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n--- Record 2800 ---\nComponent: SAP Build Process Automation\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Improved UI with New Navigation Tabs in the Action Editor\nDescription: To streamline navigation, we've added two tabs in the Action Editor: Overview and Actions. The Overview tab displays in-depth information about the action project. The Actions tab lists the API actions.\nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLatest Revision: 2024-06-07\nValid as Of: 2024-06-07\nVersion: Cloud\n\n\",952\n584,\"--- Record 2971 ---\nComponent: Trading Partner Management\nEnvironment: Cloud Foundry\nTitle: Archiving Payload Data\nDescription: You can now archive the interchange payload of your transaction activities in the agreement. They archiving feature is executed once a day and the status of the archiving can be monitored in the Monitor tab.  See:     Creating an Agreement Template    Trading Partner Agreement    \nAction: Info only\nLifecycle: General Availability\nType: Changed\nLine of Business: Technology\nLates